# Checkpoint-verification harnesses and audit scratch dirs.
#
# These are standalone dev-only scripts, run by hand via `npx tsx
# _cp_xxx_verify/verify.ts` (see CLAUDE.md) — they are never imported by
# src/ and are not part of the app. Several import `playwright`, which is
# deliberately NOT a declared dependency (it would add a heavy install to
# every production build for no runtime benefit).
#
# They are already excluded from type-checking via tsconfig.json's
# "exclude". Excluding them from the deployment as well is defence in
# depth: it keeps them out of the build context entirely, so a future
# tsconfig regression can't turn a dev harness back into a deploy blocker
# (which is exactly what happened on 2026-08-18 — _cp_08_verify/ui.mts's
# playwright import failed the production build's TypeScript pass).
_cp_*_verify
_audit_*
